Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.31,0:00:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…啊…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事大家不要慌冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都上车了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,又迟到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一边搜索小新一边避难快上车
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事大家多不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:01:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为拿着这个睡觉哎…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊对不起部长
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…噜…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦动感超人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？啊小新啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是什么地方啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们睡的是正义的大楼这里是正义的床
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊正义的床好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯只要是正义的伙伴 不管是在哪里都能睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要说出大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有不想睡觉的不好的情绪了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是动感超人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗用这张床做坟墓 在那里睡觉是最好的了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜娜子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新你在这里好好的休息一会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在正义的大楼里面没有白天和黑夜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些坏人应该怎么处理呢小新
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在正义的床上睡过觉后 正义的力量已经觉醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂帮助动感超人让正义的力量更加的强大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯很好不愧是个真正的男孩子小新
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从小的时候就一直是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的小不点用我的镰刀将你切的粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊小新你先在这里等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂没有听见我说的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯这么容易生气是缺钙的症状
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请每天喝牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对正确
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是在哪里来都可以打败你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人娜娜子就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:04:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人只有一个人把他撕碎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？啊……啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…气死你喂…气死你 喂…气死你喂…气死你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊小新干的漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有那样的勇气我必须这样做了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把动感超人吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感光波
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯战争还没有结束和你们两个一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有小新帮忙一定会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你了小新
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好小新这样很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…可是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的正义的力量才刚刚觉醒 还不明白正义的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人正义是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新那个答案是你自己得出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好那个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哈哈… 哇哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:01.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《呼风唤雨！3分钟百变大进击》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 慢慢来慢慢来 你还好吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 转个圈转个圈 转成漩涡 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再摇摇屁股充满魅力 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大家一起摇就能充满幸福 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爸爸妈妈小葵还有小白 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大家都来慢慢转个圈 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再摇摇屁股 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Y0！Y0！Y0！Y0！Y0！Y0！ ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ DEO ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大姊姊你看你看 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ DEO ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的屁屁好圆喔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ DEO ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我今年已经五岁了喔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ DEO ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 嗯…我的心脏小鹿乱撞 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这样做很难为情吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可是这样做很舒服哦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为我只是在轻松跳舞而已 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我只是在哈哈的笑而已 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这其实还满难的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.84,0:09:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉醒了哇哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.63,0:12:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘟嘟嘟嘟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇嗯？香鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:13:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊这样啊我早饭还没有吃呢 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯啊呀呀呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…哎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:13:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.77,0:14:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.35,0:14:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊我这么快就变成老天太婆了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,打你打你讨厌啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:15:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.43,0:15:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.30,0:15:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
