Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪汪汪…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪汪汪…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.24,0:15:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯汪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.75,0:16:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪汪汪…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…这里是？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.77,0:16:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊太幸运了时间好像还来得及
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊这是什么像是 好不容易才写出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么香是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢这个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是制作什么的机器？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,咕咚…嗯好吃嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,咝咝…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯咝咝…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,被发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为这里的事务太好吃的原因…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种小市民的地方还用时空转移
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么不要说因为是怪兽 就可以做这样的事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,附在这个玩具的身上我是奥特曼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个空间的调整员
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个你不吃惊吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是个人的话给小新买这样的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊…呜…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回家了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:19:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来了呜今天辛苦了.哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.01,0:19:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.95,0:19:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨嗨嗨嗨嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.13,0:19:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.26,0:19:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈我的巧克力被吃光了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？啊巧克力？很好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,累了的时候吃甜的东西.哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.11,0:19:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂小新男孩子不要这样的小事情这样小气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样是不能挽救世界的呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,咚咚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…辛苦…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙我没有出差啊…怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在洗澡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪汪汪…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？小白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪汪汪…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？嗯？唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.06,0:21:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.07,0:21:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨哟嗨哟嗨哟嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.81,0:21:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯呜嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？呜嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉嗯嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜嗯…呜嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？唉啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.15,0:22:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经出现怪兽了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:23:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的化身这里不是你住的地方嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新向日葵没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.32,0:23:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯爸爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊没事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然那样爸爸现在的…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.43,0:23:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.33,0:23:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱啊嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止吧不要在向前走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.41,0:23:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了只有这点本事吗这样的话看我的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:24:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…嘿…哎哎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人…？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.37,0:24:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.25,0:24:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.29,0:24:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊没事继续加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.37,0:24:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.12,0:24:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了看我的吧怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:25:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.82,0:25:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.19,0:25:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.65,0:25:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.37,0:25:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到底是怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊我也是因为追爸爸才来到这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.97,0:25:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了追我？从那个卷轴来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.58,0:25:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.55,0:25:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么美芽也到这里来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.41,0:25:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:25:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,美芽
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.59,0:25:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.85,0:26:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.52,0:26:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.09,0:26:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分钟的世界？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.86,0:26:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.36,0:26:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人无法相信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.37,0:26:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是真的好像有这样的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.53,0:26:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯刚好是三分钟吃饭的时间啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.41,0:26:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你又是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.54,0:26:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奥特曼从遥远的未来来到这里 是时空调整员
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未来来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.58,0:26:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂刚才说的话请在说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.42,0:26:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是从未来的世界来到这个时空… 也就是被派遣到这个世界里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.62,0:26:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不久这个世界就要被灭亡了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.89,0:26:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界毁灭？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.13,0:26:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的为了制止这场杀戮 我被派遣到这里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.97,0:26:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等为什么这个世界会毁灭呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为怪兽才被毁灭的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.60,0:26:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽？刚才的那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.74,0:26:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是不是还有一个漂亮的姑娘 打败它了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.48,0:27:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐厉害的姐姐我喜欢…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.58,0:27:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.68,0:27:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽从刚才那个城堡里面不断的出现
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.19,0:27:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为时空发生弯曲了不管怎么做都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.42,0:27:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那个可爱的姑娘打败了怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.43,0:27:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,城堡遗留下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.63,0:27:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,咝…姐姐和怪兽作战 呼…呼…的将怪兽收服了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.93,0:27:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊怪兽吧不是有生命的东西 它们的能量到底是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.61,0:27:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.57,0:27:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.07,0:27:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的要是时空没有被扭曲的话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.81,0:27:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个城堡也会被消灭怪兽也不会在出现
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.25,0:27:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.75,0:27:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到这里来是为了预防未来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.46,0:27:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了请将怪兽返回到原来的世界去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.96,0:27:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回？谁怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.46,0:27:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个漂亮的姐姐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是就是那样我也是那样想的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.63,0:27:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.57,0:27:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.24,0:28:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之一会在解释来吧快点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.98,0:28:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…？喂等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.54,0:28:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢？出动了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.55,0:28:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.48,0:28:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.45,0:28:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？没有被破坏啊 和刚才一样啊是什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.56,0:28:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才的姐姐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.73,0:28:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.87,0:28:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀好了哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.17,0:28:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？那个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.57,0:28:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.71,0:28:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.11,0:28:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好恐怖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.82,0:28:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.59,0:28:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.40,0:28:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.87,0:28:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,美芽
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.67,0:29:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.70,0:29:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.77,0:29:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.62,0:29:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,美少女战士变身完成
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使不认可也是可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.19,0:29:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.56,0:29:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…那个姑娘是美芽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么破坏小孩子的梦想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.07,0:29:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要在走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.14,0:29:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的情书
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你用有力一点的攻击好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这样看起来很可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.08,0:29:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在干什么呢给它情书
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊妈妈…姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.66,0:29:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.87,0:30:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.37,0:30:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.71,0:30:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔？嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.85,0:30:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇？啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.42,0:30:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个给我试试小新
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.22,0:30:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.66,0:30:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.13,0:30:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么怎么变成这个样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.77,0:30:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己的想象力不够丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.64,0:30:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,切下次一定变成一个帅点的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.64,0:30:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.81,0:30:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.68,0:30:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.65,0:30:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.49,0:31:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.76,0:31:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.16,0:31:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好不管你是从哪里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.44,0:31:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…这才是刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.67,0:31:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利是属于正义的一方的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.84,0:31:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次看我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.51,0:31:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.85,0:31:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.72,0:31:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.83,0:31:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样总可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.83,0:31:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.57,0:31:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.70,0:31:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈…去附近的一家怎么样？啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.51,0:31:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊那人？不是现在的部长吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.71,0:31:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.01,0:32:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.79,0:32:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.96,0:32:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？部长
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.79,0:32:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是野原君
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.73,0:32:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么野原君？好帅啊怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.33,0:32:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么危险还没有结束一会在说
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.74,0:32:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.04,0:32:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜…我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.61,0:32:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打我打
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.08,0:32:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.25,0:32:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开爸爸离开
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.85,0:32:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.82,0:32:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.42,0:32:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.93,0:32:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…等等等等
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.77,0:33:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊好危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.47,0:33:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快趁现在把它吸收了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.04,0:33:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸收？怎么做啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.55,0:33:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个吗？那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.62,0:33:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.52,0:33:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.09,0:33:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.06,0:33:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.83,0:33:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长没有受伤吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.10,0:33:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊可是…你真的很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.04,0:33:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么我的力量从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.54,0:33:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.94,0:33:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.37,0:33:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好野原君
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.88,0:33:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.94,0:33:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.95,0:33:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.89,0:33:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.92,0:33:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.43,0:33:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.33,0:34:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊嗯唉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊唉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.34,0:34:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.71,0:34:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉？唉？唉？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.71,0:34:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之怪兽倒下了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.92,0:34:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要是三分钟以内回到这里来 时空的扭曲就被消除了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.96,0:34:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.86,0:34:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.02,0:34:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的说就是像修理时空的水管
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.00,0:34:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,水管？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.23,0:34:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢拉面烤肉不管什么都喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.87,0:34:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是像是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.11,0:34:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用水管的时候 要是有坏掉的或是漏水的地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.08,0:34:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在修理的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.58,0:34:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,使流动的水从旁边的管道流过
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.39,0:34:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏掉的水管不就可以更换了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.92,0:34:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的水管要等待三分钟的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.56,0:35:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧？奥特曼
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.13,0:35:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一般的理解来说就是那个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.43,0:35:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之在三分钟以内的时间里 将怪兽打回到原来的世界回去我…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.51,0:35:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是为什么刚才美芽和我能够变成呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.98,0:35:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,时空管理官的万能对应的管理系统
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.72,0:35:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能变身的情况下…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.75,0:35:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.12,0:35:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,将力量给代表正义的人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.03,0:35:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊嘿嘿啊哇哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.93,0:35:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘟嘟…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护正义的心越强
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.64,0:35:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够接受正义的力量也越强
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.61,0:35:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊所以这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.45,0:35:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样即使是一般的家庭也是可以完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.32,0:36:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上代表正义什么的按照你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.16,0:36:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一般的家庭了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.29,0:36:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我的身体变成这样的玩具的形状
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.13,0:36:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统的坐标已经固定了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.16,0:36:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经决定是你们一家了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仅仅是被拉面的香味吸引来的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.77,0:36:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.77,0:36:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.08,0:36:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时候只想到拉面我打算那样的事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.15,0:36:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了好了刚才说的已经足够了我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.98,0:36:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.79,0:36:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要我也要…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.09,0:36:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要…我要…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.69,0:36:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是身为时空管理官的奥特曼…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.03,0:36:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道未来的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.99,0:36:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.49,0:36:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我我什么时候能升职成部长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.06,0:36:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.20,0:36:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.50,0:36:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,明年可能是有一点早后年的话可能会成功
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我也是部长夫人了…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.28,0:37:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来告诉我将来发生的事情知道未来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.61,0:37:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事我不是想占有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.78,0:37:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊不那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.12,0:37:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是大事的话还可以 那样的小事情我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.79,0:37:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的事情即使是特意的打听也没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.73,0:37:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的未来是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.76,0:37:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,万人迷的帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.60,0:37:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.53,0:37:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.87,0:37:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时候妹妹也长大了…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.77,0:37:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎你的哥哥是那个帅哥吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.41,0:37:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯我是他唯一的妹妹怎么样羡慕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.61,0:37:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.21,0:37:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我介绍一下喂把我介绍给你的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.15,0:37:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀…我…我真的很为难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.59,0:37:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.32,0:37:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新成为一个帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.09,0:37:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成为部长就这样决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.06,0:37:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于专务或者是社长什么的就不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.06,0:37:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.07,0:37:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.17,0:37:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么怪兽回去了时空扭曲已经中止了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.80,0:38:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就能守护好美好的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要发出像猫一样的声音知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.08,0:38:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,必要的话我们变身将怪兽消灭好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.32,0:38:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽太软弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.78,0:38:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新都可能胜利的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.32,0:38:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢我也要变身变身…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.86,0:38:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.09,0:38:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这样好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.29,0:38:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管什么时间我们都会帮助你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.33,0:38:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利很容易胜利…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.40,0:38:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我变身哇哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.70,0:38:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.90,0:38:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好野原一家出发
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.17,0:38:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.41,0:38:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.71,0:38:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.41,0:38:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.78,0:38:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.11,0:38:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.22,0:38:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个企划书是上次提出来的没有变化啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.19,0:38:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经说了几遍了你不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.62,0:38:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂部长不要这样生气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.76,0:38:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚在六本木没有帮助部长吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.13,0:38:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.93,0:38:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.73,0:39:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.37,0:39:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入卷轴里面发生的 三分钟的事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.51,0:39:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之在三分钟以内将怪兽返回到 原来的世界的话我…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.64,0:39:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.95,0:39:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.52,0:39:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见有人和你在说话了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.15,0:39:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对不起部长
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.83,0:39:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.23,0:39:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…部长
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.94,0:39:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.24,0:39:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.28,0:39:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.38,0:39:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.72,0:39:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.96,0:39:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.36,0:40:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.76,0:40:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.20,0:40:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇腹肌明显了手脚也长了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.61,0:40:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.81,0:40:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.98,0:40:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好用快攻来收拾你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.45,0:40:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.36,0:40:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢.太好了.仅仅就想想 马上就变成想要的姿态了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.30,0:40:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是因为符合正义的心发挥出来的力量吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.84,0:40:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的出发
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.81,0:40:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.42,0:40:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝到我的厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.79,0:41:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是很强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.33,0:41:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.76,0:41:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家伙怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.37,0:41:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.97,0:41:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.31,0:41:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.94,0:41:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢？呼呼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.28,0:41:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…呼呼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.18,0:41:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.15,0:41:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？呼呼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.39,0:41:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.30,0:41:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿完事了真没用
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.40,0:41:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭曲的时空系统要是括散了 马上就会产生混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.31,0:41:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请快点将它吸收
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.42,0:42:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.32,0:42:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.82,0:42:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然出现在我们面前的怪兽 打倒怪兽的是一个像谜一样的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.23,0:42:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.83,0:42:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？啊…野原广志
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.67,0:42:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了三分钟了回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.10,0:42:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.91,0:42:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.01,0:42:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.48,0:42:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.91,0:42:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂美芽
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.38,0:42:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.18,0:42:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.59,0:42:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.36,0:42:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.22,0:42:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘟嘟…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.06,0:42:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊我讨厌这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.46,0:42:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘟嘟…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.17,0:42:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.04,0:43:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀哈…嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.25,0:43:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.06,0:43:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.66,0:43:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.96,0:43:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.23,0:43:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？噢？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.60,0:43:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢？呀呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.40,0:43:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.25,0:43:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.48,0:43:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…哎…哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.49,0:43:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.30,0:43:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸收它吧小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.96,0:43:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.61,0:44:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.44,0:44:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.64,0:44:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.68,0:44:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.45,0:44:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.82,0:44:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.20,0:44:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.23,0:44:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.24,0:44:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身美芽X
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.09,0:45:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.60,0:45:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.00,0:45:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇这样也能变的出来这样的变身太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.37,0:45:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的风格也能变出来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.11,0:45:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,美芽来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.01,0:45:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.51,0:45:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽这里不是你应该待的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.65,0:45:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.76,0:45:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哎.哎哎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.90,0:45:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了游戏的时间结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.60,0:45:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢像你这样的长的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.08,0:45:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.85,0:46:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.08,0:46:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯你和我挑战还早29年呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.72,0:46:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是对于美芽X来说 吸尘器不合适啊？呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.29,0:46:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,8.910 好了好了啊嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.23,0:46:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是出去的话马上穿上衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.46,0:46:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.67,0:46:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.60,0:46:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,广志怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.30,0:46:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗好今天又看我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.61,0:46:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯好天气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.84,0:46:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？咻咻… 这个气味是爸爸的脚的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.99,0:47:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.72,0:47:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊这个怪兽是正常的怪兽啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那个光一闪一闪的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.63,0:47:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个时间里我是无敌的你的肚子是空的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.77,0:47:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.14,0:47:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇啊…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.85,0:47:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家晚上好我是坂井真记
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.75,0:47:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然出现的怪兽和
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.15,0:47:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和突然出现的和那个怪兽作战的超人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.16,0:47:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是现实里面发生的事情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.16,0:47:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么那些是做报道的吗真是丢人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.20,0:47:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.40,0:47:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.93,0:47:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.20,0:47:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.67,0:48:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家伙混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.67,0:48:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜？爸爸在这里干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.74,0:48:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个看见见了吗那个那个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.74,0:48:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？噢？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.81,0:48:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.55,0:48:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐在干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.85,0:48:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视电视我们现在都上电视了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.82,0:48:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？不
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.26,0:48:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有这样糟糕过
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.26,0:48:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.30,0:48:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身小新
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.73,0:48:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.93,0:48:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.85,0:48:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太厉害了超人的儿子是超人的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.32,0:48:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新在电视机前干的漂亮点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.79,0:48:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.49,0:48:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新小心那个光
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.50,0:49:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的首先把你的袜子脱下来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.90,0:49:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.94,0:49:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊这这…干什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.51,0:49:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.77,0:49:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.88,0:49:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出这么大的声音给你尝尝爸爸的脚的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.85,0:49:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点将这个家伙消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.86,0:49:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是爸爸的脚的气味好果然是厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.27,0:49:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？你干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.77,0:49:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.37,0:49:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.14,0:49:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋洒尿了小新
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.94,0:49:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦我的小鸡鸡好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.88,0:49:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.82,0:49:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哦哦嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.79,0:49:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.36,0:49:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.79,0:50:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字是？一般怎么称呼你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.63,0:50:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看从我的小鸡鸡洒出去的尿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.13,0:50:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.96,0:50:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原君三分钟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.30,0:50:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.80,0:50:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎结束了吗？没有我说话的时间了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.50,0:50:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在等一下不管怎么说先等等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.84,0:50:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.31,0:50:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.81,0:50:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把麦克风借我用用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.88,0:50:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.81,0:50:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.41,0:50:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯部长你个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.45,0:50:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.48,0:50:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.42,0:50:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.65,0:50:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我录的都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.86,0:50:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈…实在是太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.70,0:50:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也从小鸡鸡洒尿太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.46,0:50:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.83,0:50:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么刚面对着镜头为什么就回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.04,0:50:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是变身作战的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.17,0:50:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,白发和小的皱纹都没有了润滑的肌肤
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.34,0:50:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊我也有成块的肌肉了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.98,0:50:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常的健壮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.48,0:50:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来了瞧这么弱
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.68,0:50:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是一直变身就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.85,0:51:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.36,0:51:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？在哪里？这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.56,0:51:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,海？啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.73,0:51:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊鱼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.90,0:51:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…怪兽来了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.87,0:51:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.91,0:51:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来救救我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.88,0:51:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊好啊.那个是伊卡买集团的吗好机会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.38,0:51:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我在这里美女救英雄吧… 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.58,0:51:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.89,0:51:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许你破坏海的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.96,0:51:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.24,0:51:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.44,0:52:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.92,0:52:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜前进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.66,0:52:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,转转转…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.29,0:52:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,转…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.03,0:52:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,美人鱼看我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.94,0:52:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,美芽快点吸收它
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.54,0:52:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了哎来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.95,0:52:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.02,0:52:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…等一下.还有剩余的工作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.29,0:52:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.03,0:52:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来救救我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.59,0:52:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来帮帮你们吧哎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.10,0:52:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊…嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.04,0:53:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.18,0:53:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.08,0:53:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…没事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.98,0:53:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.85,0:53:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？这件事是我和大家的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.26,0:53:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊是谢谢女神谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.00,0:53:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈…太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.00,0:53:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,美芽三分钟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.14,0:53:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.54,0:53:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿哇呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.11,0:53:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…嘿…哇呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.05,0:53:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.38,0:53:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.08,0:53:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌的家伙放火烧别人家
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.52,0:53:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样坏的家伙你是最坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.16,0:53:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…哇呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.53,0:53:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.73,0:54:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈…没用的没用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.27,0:54:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.20,0:54:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了看看我的肺活量
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.84,0:54:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,咝咝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.28,0:54:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.05,0:54:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…哇…哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.08,0:54:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊…啊…不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.29,0:54:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.06,0:54:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈…什么？那个是你的真身吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.41,0:54:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.81,0:54:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.75,0:54:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…螃蟹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.58,0:54:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,螃蟹最近好像没有吃过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.09,0:54:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太忙了总是吃些速食产品
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.89,0:55:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂要是把它打倒了能拿回家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.39,0:55:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么不要说些废话了快点去干活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.70,0:55:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,耍赖好吧看我的变身
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.21,0:55:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在开始限制你的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.62,0:55:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,美芽X华丽登场
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.29,0:55:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.90,0:55:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.90,0:55:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.74,0:55:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.65,0:55:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.19,0:56:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,奉神的旨意
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.83,0:56:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个完成
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.17,0:56:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人勇猛的武士
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.21,0:56:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是野原幸之助野原幸之助
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.25,0:56:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常喜欢姐姐住在春日市现在已经5岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.69,0:56:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能不说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.73,0:56:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你十三年里一直像是个五岁的儿童
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.21,0:56:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.28,0:57:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上给我出来野原幸之助我杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.96,0:57:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.29,0:57:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你不是勇猛的武士你是怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.73,0:57:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,和小孩子作对吗夹
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.11,0:57:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为愚蠢的人也能够出来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.48,0:57:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,切腹
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.35,0:57:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯要小便了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.39,0:57:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？从早晨开始就吃拉面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.22,0:57:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然喜欢可是也不能每天都吃这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.59,0:57:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃够了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.40,0:57:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房间也应该好好的收拾一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.63,0:57:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了可是没有办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.24,0:58:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是出现怪兽你不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.87,0:58:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了守护世界
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.61,0:58:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,切不仅仅是你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.48,0:58:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是在夜晚变身不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.11,0:58:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是没有办法啊因为有工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.32,0:58:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯咝咝
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.45,0:58:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？发工资？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.69,0:58:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯因为是为了守护世界
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.63,0:58:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是不知道怪兽什么时候可能出现
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.53,0:58:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是应该多少知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.87,0:58:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样啊奥特曼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.63,0:58:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实时空扭曲正在变小
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.94,0:58:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要太长的时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.14,0:58:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.41,0:58:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么以后不知道还能有多少次变身
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.38,0:58:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？不为了什么不想我的工资吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.15,0:58:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的怪兽全都交给我了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.85,0:58:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么你在说什么？原来是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.82,0:58:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说什么胜利的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.79,0:58:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,击退怪兽是男人的工作女人到一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.40,0:59:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么你才应该到一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.90,0:59:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等两个人一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.47,0:59:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸和妈妈说的都不对
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.70,0:59:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想击退怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.50,0:59:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.51,0:59:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吵…你们老天实的在家里待着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.38,0:59:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大…大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.68,0:59:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊交给这样一般的家庭好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.79,1:01:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.99,1:01:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.56,1:01:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.00,1:01:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.13,1:01:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊为什么最近怪兽 总是一起出现呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.67,1:01:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很累啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.17,1:01:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有那样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.10,1:01:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人都已经累了的话为什么不交给我呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.91,1:01:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢.你刚才不是很危险吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.11,1:01:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎？没有这回事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.88,1:01:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.88,1:01:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是最强的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.39,1:01:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…喂…呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.72,1:01:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.96,1:01:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点出现怪兽啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.56,1:01:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.53,1:01:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在三分钟的世界里 将我们的身影录下来就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.10,1:01:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.37,1:01:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.24,1:02:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？呜？啊爸爸宝宝饿了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.62,1:02:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是没办法好了来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.75,1:02:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.62,1:02:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新妈妈现在离不开 你替妈妈给拿宝宝牛奶
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.76,1:02:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.13,1:02:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新拜托了你不是最强的超人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.93,1:02:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的人要帮助弱小的人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.34,1:02:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯啊啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.58,1:02:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.39,1:02:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥给你做超级可爱的牛奶
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.66,1:02:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经说了很多次了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.29,1:02:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是长大的话一定给哥哥介绍漂亮的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.99,1:02:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.40,1:02:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.30,1:02:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.30,1:02:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.34,1:02:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.67,1:03:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.47,1:03:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.01,1:03:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.61,1:03:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.98,1:03:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.06,1:03:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去幼儿园吗？小新
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.93,1:03:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我们都不得不守护世界
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.50,1:03:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊回来的时候买些拉面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.07,1:03:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.61,1:03:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.84,1:03:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.84,1:03:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.54,1:03:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.65,1:03:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.85,1:03:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.72,1:03:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎…嗯…嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.36,1:03:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.36,1:03:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才说的话真的不要忘记啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.66,1:04:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.40,1:04:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新为什么到妹妹来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.41,1:04:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为爸爸和妈妈去打怪兽了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.38,1:04:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.88,1:04:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂妈妈在干什么呢 为什么门口堆满了垃圾啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.39,1:04:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为整天想着打怪兽什么都不做了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.73,1:04:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在做游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.90,1:04:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是去别的世界 将真的怪兽赶回到原来的世界去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.67,1:04:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.04,1:04:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为热衷于这个游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.61,1:04:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始现场转播
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.74,1:04:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是现场请看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.55,1:04:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎不知道为什么 突然塌毁的百货商店
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.08,1:04:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是突然倒塌的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.42,1:04:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,园长
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.49,1:04:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.79,1:04:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才的话听见了吗？现在把电视机关掉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.92,1:05:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.53,1:05:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊等等
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.33,1:05:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.99,1:05:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,百货商店里面还有数十人 被关在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.93,1:05:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难被救护
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.94,1:05:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是玫瑰幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.94,1:05:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.94,1:05:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.04,1:05:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妈妈好像在那个百货商店里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.45,1:05:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有受伤听说已经回家了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.65,1:05:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也回到你的妈妈身边吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.65,1:05:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.55,1:05:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.76,1:05:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不可思议的云 突然间出现渐渐的在变大
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.46,1:05:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这个云的原因完全的不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.73,1:05:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是什么以前从没有出现过
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.93,1:05:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个应该是一个异常的气象
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.90,1:05:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿嘿…嘿嘿嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.98,1:05:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…嘿…嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.92,1:06:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.02,1:06:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.16,1:06:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.46,1:06:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.83,1:06:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.00,1:06:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.76,1:06:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在三分钟的时间里没有将怪兽击退
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.93,1:06:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了一个强大的怪兽 不是以前那个级别的了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.20,1:06:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,用两个人的力量一边躲避一边逃回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.64,1:06:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.74,1:06:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是终极的本领可是太强大了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.08,1:06:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是作为时空调节员的变身 可是也是有限度的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.05,1:06:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以外的有正义感的人 让他们去不可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.16,1:06:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有正义感的人很多
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.46,1:06:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是即使来了也不能像野原君这样的战斗 这样一直慢腾腾的…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.46,1:06:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢腾腾的…？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.73,1:06:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有等待着世界灭亡了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.47,1:06:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.97,1:06:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.74,1:06:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然在东京塔上空出现的黑云
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.47,1:06:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然在不断的括大变强
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.71,1:06:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事情呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.98,1:07:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做主持的28年间
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.48,1:07:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是下一个怪兽出现的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.05,1:07:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在三分钟的时间里没有将它击退的话 怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.99,1:07:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候出现怪兽 不是什么奇怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.99,1:07:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都已经这个样子了还怎么能够冷静呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.13,1:07:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.09,1:07:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.23,1:07:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖…乖…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.56,1:07:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.06,1:07:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请继续收看坂井
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.00,1:07:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里是东京塔的上空请看
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.04,1:07:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上空的黑云上面 能看见一个像是城堡一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.31,1:07:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是什么呢？黑云也在渐渐的括大
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.85,1:07:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本世界将要被这个黑云吞噬了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.18,1:07:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的世界到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.79,1:07:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.72,1:07:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.13,1:07:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.77,1:07:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.03,1:07:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,动感超人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.67,1:07:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.70,1:08:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形金刚
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.17,1:08:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢的超人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.54,1:08:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这个是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.54,1:08:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.04,1:08:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是我的超人小猪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.18,1:08:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我发生什么事情了回来帮助我的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.55,1:08:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.62,1:08:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.35,1:08:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.26,1:08:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.56,1:08:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.06,1:08:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.49,1:08:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…喂…呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.47,1:08:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜…哇…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.34,1:08:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.17,1:08:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.04,1:08:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.34,1:08:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新你即使是去了也…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.68,1:08:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.34,1:08:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要不要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.68,1:08:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因为我是宝宝都喜欢的大哥
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.35,1:08:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝长大成为女生不能被怪兽破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.15,1:08:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的人要帮助弱小的人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.06,1:08:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.86,1:09:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.13,1:09:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.20,1:09:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.01,1:09:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯呜？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.20,1:09:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.30,1:09:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.97,1:09:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么出现的是最后才来的 两个眼睛的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.04,1:09:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后从城堡里面出现的怪兽不可想象
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.14,1:09:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜…嗯…嗯…啊？啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.75,1:09:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新你太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.18,1:09:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是宝宝的哥哥我是你们的父母
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.45,1:09:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.92,1:09:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.22,1:09:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.26,1:09:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.92,1:10:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦小白你也来了谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.06,1:10:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是英雄我对你们说谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.00,1:10:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不我们是在守护世界不是什么英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.10,1:10:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了孩子们的未来 生存着想的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.60,1:10:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.21,1:10:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.71,1:10:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.04,1:10:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯野原一家冲啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.95,1:10:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,走变身
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.69,1:10:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿哈…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.96,1:10:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.20,1:10:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.17,1:10:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.00,1:10:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.17,1:10:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.88,1:10:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.08,1:10:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.12,1:11:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哎
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.12,1:11:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.06,1:11:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,美芽坚持住
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.87,1:11:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.00,1:11:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.11,1:11:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.81,1:11:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是粘土一样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.51,1:11:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,广志后面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.81,1:11:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.15,1:11:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.35,1:11:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.39,1:11:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.23,1:11:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.14,1:12:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.58,1:12:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.56,1:12:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.16,1:12:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.06,1:12:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.56,1:12:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.40,1:12:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.07,1:12:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.67,1:12:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.77,1:12:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿呀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.08,1:12:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.28,1:12:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.32,1:12:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.75,1:12:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.69,1:12:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.22,1:12:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.86,1:12:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,自卫队来帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.38,1:13:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都透过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.61,1:13:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.82,1:13:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是这样的话这以后 不管是什么样的进攻…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.13,1:13:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生变异了即使是在强的武器也不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.20,1:13:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽一旦发生变异相反 人类只有等待着灭亡了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.30,1:13:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.77,1:13:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这之后的自卫队的进攻以前没有别的办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.34,1:13:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.64,1:13:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.81,1:13:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.45,1:13:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.02,1:13:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝我去看着爸爸和妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.79,1:13:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.72,1:13:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新不要去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.29,1:13:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要小新我去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.69,1:13:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.93,1:14:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了将来和爸爸 妈妈还有宝宝大家能够生存
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.30,1:14:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.54,1:14:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
